CM_ "Z4 GT3 ABS/DSC module (Continental MK60E5 / DSC60, software ZB 6769162). Derived from analysis of the module software. Node DSC = this module. Only fields the software computes or uses are included; received fields it ignores and transmitted fields with a fixed value are left out. Scaling is given where it is established; other fields are raw. Byte/bit numbering 0-based, little-endian (Intel). Fault references are the DTC numbers the module reports over KWP $18. Bus: second CAN (F-CAN) to the yaw/acceleration sensor cluster.";
CM_ BO_ 307 "Sensor cluster, 10 ms: one 16-bit value; reception marks the cluster as present. Received by this module, every 10 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 306 "Sensor cluster status, 10 ms: status nibbles, four status bytes and the ready/self-test flags the firmware uses to hold or release the cluster signals. Received by this module, every 10 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 305 "Sensor cluster, channel set B, 10 ms: two supervision words and the longitudinal acceleration, with status, counter and CRC-8. Received by this module, every 10 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 304 "Yaw/acceleration sensor cluster, channel set A, 10 ms: yaw rate, lateral acceleration and a supervision word, with status, alive counter and CRC-8. The source of yaw and ay. A frozen counter or bad CRC rejects the frame. Received by this module, every 10 ms.";
CM_ SG_ 304 YawRate "Yaw rate from the sensor cluster (word 0). Scale derived from the module's own yaw output on 0x4A8. Sign convention opposite to the BMW M3 cluster.";
CM_ SG_ 304 LateralAccel_Raw "Lateral acceleration from the sensor cluster (word 2), raw.";
CM_ SG_ 304 Word4 "Cluster word 4, supervision only.";
CM_ SG_ 304 Status_A "2-bit status field.";
CM_ SG_ 304 Status_B "2-bit status field.";
CM_ SG_ 304 AliveCounter "Frozen counter -> message rejected.";
CM_ SG_ 304 Checksum "CRC-8 of bytes 0-6 (poly 0x1D, start 0xFF, inverted); mismatch -> message rejected.";
CM_ SG_ 305 Word1 "Cluster word 1, supervision only.";
CM_ SG_ 305 Word3 "Cluster word 3, supervision only.";
CM_ SG_ 305 LongitudinalAccel_Raw "Longitudinal acceleration from the sensor cluster (word 5), raw.";
CM_ SG_ 305 Status_A "2-bit status field.";
CM_ SG_ 305 Status_B "2-bit status field.";
CM_ SG_ 305 AliveCounter "Own counter.";
CM_ SG_ 305 Checksum "CRC-8 as 0x130.";
CM_ SG_ 306 Nibble0_lo "Cluster status nibble.";
CM_ SG_ 306 Nibble0_hi "Cluster status nibble.";
CM_ SG_ 306 Nibble1_lo "Cluster status nibble.";
CM_ SG_ 306 Nibble1_hi "Cluster status nibble.";
CM_ SG_ 306 Byte2 "Cluster status byte (stored; read by the cluster supervision).";
CM_ SG_ 306 Byte3 "Cluster status byte (stored).";
CM_ SG_ 306 Byte4 "Cluster status byte (stored).";
CM_ SG_ 306 Byte5 "Cluster status byte (stored).";
CM_ SG_ 306 ReadyFlags "Cluster ready / self-test flags; the module holds the cluster signals until they report ready.";
CM_ SG_ 306 AliveCounter "Alive counter; frozen -> frame rejected.";
CM_ SG_ 306 Checksum "CRC-8 as 0x130.";
CM_ SG_ 307 Value "16-bit value; marks the cluster as seen.";

